    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the quick reply. i'm just a bit freaked out about the hospital thing. i don't have any other symptoms like trouble speaking or weakness in my arm, it's literally just the face thing. it feels more like a nerve issue than anything else. do you think it's possible it's just bells palsy? i've read online that it's usually not a stroke if it's just one side of the face like this.",
